<p>Conjures a mudslide, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">153, 205, 246, 281, 312</acronym> physical damage in a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8.</acronym> Any creatures caught inside will be knocked back 8 spaces.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>